# Let Sleeping Dogs Lie (windurst 46): its replies next to rival lines, so a Progress line and an Event line differ.
# Accepted by GM with Making the Grade accepted too (both at Prog 0), a level-10 WAR, Teacher's Pet completed, Windurst
# fame 225. NPC scripts made to answer on their turn, as in making_the_grade#compete: Fuepepe's 817 (Class Reunion),
# Pechiru-Mashiru's 54 (the New Model Hat), Mashuu-Ajuu's 464 / 476 (Reap What You Sow accepted), Moreno-Toeno's
# 441 / 469 (always). The lookup: a Progress line plays on any talk; an Event line takes turns with the script; two or
# three Event lines of the same handler cycle. Prog 0: Paku-Nakku 482 / 452; Fuepepe 493 / 817 / 443; Pechiru-Mashiru
# 490 / 54 / 445; the children (this quest's 48x, Making the Grade's 44x / 45x) twice each; Mashuu-Ajuu 483 / script /
# 448; Moreno-Toeno 491 / 444 / 439 with his script between. Prog 3: Paku-Nakku 499 (Progress) over 452, twice. Making
# the Grade at Prog 2: Chomoro-Kyotoro's 460 (Progress) over this quest's 489, twice (Prog 2 again by GM). Prog 2
# Option 1: Pechiru-Mashiru's 495 (Progress) on her script's turn, twice. Prog 4: 497 (Progress) with a full bag
# (nothing), then 497: completed.
lists WindurstWaters/Paku-Nakku/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Fuepepe/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Pechiru-Mashiru/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Akkeke/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Chomoro-Kyotoro/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Foi-Mui/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Kirarara/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Koko_Lihzeh/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Rukuku/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Mashuu-Ajuu/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Moreno-Toeno/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=131,-5.75,165 job=WAR lvl=10
quest Windurst.TeachersPet completed
quest Windurst.MakingTheGrade accepted
quest Windurst.LetSleepingDogsLie accepted
quest Windurst.ClassReunion accepted
